We need modify index.html: map visuals, biomes, goal 5000 with 5 biomes (each 1000m). Blend transitions.

Need inspect current world rendering/gen. We know code. Plan:
- GOAL_M 5000.
- Define BIOMES array with 5: e.g., Meadow/Green Valley (0-1000), Ashwood/Dead Forest (1000-2000), Rusty Wastes/Desert (2000-3000), Frostbite Pass/Snow (3000-4000), Emberlands/Volcanic (4000-5000). Mobile top-down, colors.
- World background color per biome and blend via interpolation. Need smooth transition near boundaries (e.g., blend zone 150-200m around each boundary), including background ground color, grass patches, tree colors maybe, other props.
- `draw()` currently bg fill '#222e1b', patches fixed colors, grass fixed, trees fixed, rocks. We can compute biome weights at world y and blend colors.
- Each biome affects:
  - base ground color
  - patch colors
  - grass color
  - tree foliage color/shape maybe (dead trees in ashwood, cactus in desert, snow pines, charred trees)
  - rocks color
